ram kaarana(n) ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਕ੍ਰਿਪਾਲੂ ਤੇ ਬਸ਼ਸ਼ਿਸ਼ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲਾ ਹੈ,"}}},{"verse_id":84492,"page_no":221,"line_no":84492,"gurmukhi":"ਬਿਹਾਲ ਦਿਆਲ ਤਾਰਣੰ ॥੨੦੪॥","translit_en":"bihaal dhiaal taarana(n) ||204||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"“He is merciful and kind towards all and mercifully gives support to helpless and ferries them across.204."},"pu":{"ss":"ਮਾੜੀ ਹਾਲਤ ਨੂੰ ਸੁਧਾਰਨ ਵਾਲਾ ਦਿਆਲੂ ਹੈ ॥੨੦੪॥"}}},{"verse_id":84493,"page_no":221,"line_no":84493,"gurmukhi":"ਅਨੇਕ ਸੰਤ ਤਾਰਣੰ ॥","translit_en":"anek sa(n)t taarana(n) ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਅਨੇਕਾ ਸੰਤਾ ਨੂੰ ਤਾਰਨ ਵਾਲਾ ਹੇ,"}}},{"verse_id":84494,"page_no":221,"line_no":84494,"gurmukhi":"ਅਦੇਵ ਦੇਵ ਕਾਰਣੰ ॥","translit_en":"adhev dhev kaarana(n) ||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"“He is the saviour of many saints and is the basic cause of the gods and demons."},"pu":{"ss":"ਦੈਂਤਾ ਤੇ ਦੇਵਤਿਆਂ ਦਾ ਕਾਰਨ ਰੂਪ ਹੈ।"}}},{"verse_id":84495,"page_no":221,"line_no":84495,"gurmukhi":"ਸੁਰੇਸ ਭਾਇ ਰੂਪਣੰ ॥","translit_en":"sures bhai roopana(n) ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਇੰਦਰ ਦੇ ਸਰੂਪ ਵਾਲਾ ਹੈ"}}},{"verse_id":84496,"page_no":221,"line_no":84496,"gurmukhi":"ਸਮਿੱਧ੍ਰ ਸਿੱਧ ਕੂਪਣੰ ॥੨੦੫॥","translit_en":"sami'dhr si'dh koopana(n) ||205||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"“He is also the king of gods and is the store of all powers.”205."},"pu":{"ss":"ਅਤੇ ਸਿੱਧੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਅਮੁੱਕ ਭੰਡਾਰ ਹੈ ॥੨੦੫॥"}}},{"verse_id":84497,"page_no":221,"line_no":84497,"gurmukhi":"ਬਰੰ ਨਰੇਸ ਦੀਜੀਐ ॥","translit_en":"bara(n) nares dheejeeaai ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"(ਫਿਰ ਕੈਕਈ ਕਹਿਣ ਲੱਗੀ-) ਹੇ ਰਾਜਨ! (ਮੈਨੂੰ) ਵਰ ਦਿਓ।"}}},{"verse_id":84498,"page_no":221,"line_no":84498,"gurmukhi":"ਕਹੇ ਸੁ ਪੂਰ ਕੀਜੀਐ ॥","translit_en":"kahe su poor keejeeaai ||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"The queen said, “O king! Grant me the boons and fulfil thy sayins."},"pu":{"ss":"ਜੋ (ਤੁਸੀਂ) ਕਹੇ ਹੋਏ ਹਨ, ਉਹ ਪੂਰੇ ਕਰੋ।"}}},{"verse_id":84499,"page_no":221,"line_no":84499,"gurmukhi":"ਨ ਸੰਕ ਰਾਜ ਧਾਰੀਐ ॥","translit_en":"n sa(n)k raaj dhaareeaai ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਹੇ ਰਾਜਨ! ਮਨ ਵਿੱਚ ਕੋਈ ਸ਼ੰਕਾ ਨਾ ਧਾਰੋ,"}}},{"verse_id":84500,"page_no":221,"line_no":84500,"gurmukhi":"ਨ ਬੋਲ ਬੋਲ ਹਾਰੀਐ ॥੨੦੬॥","translit_en":"n bol bol haareeaai ||206||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"“Adandon the position of duality from your mind and do not fail in your promise.”206."},"pu":{"ss":"ਬੋਲ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਬੋਲ ਤੋਂ ਨਾ ਹਾਰੋ ॥੨੦੬॥"}}}],"nav":{"prev":7930,"next":7932}}